-- TB_LKTN Rumah Rakyat — BIM COBOL Production Recipe
-- Building: TB-LKTN (Terraced house, Rumah Rakyat program)
-- DocSubType: TB
-- This script defines HOW to compile the building.

-- ── STRUCTURAL CHECKS ──

CHECK BOM TB_LKTN

-- ── MEP INSTALLATION ──

WIRE LIGHTING TB_LKTN "Ground Floor" bilik_utama
WIRE LIGHTING TB_LKTN "Ground Floor" bilik_2
WIRE LIGHTING TB_LKTN "Ground Floor" bilik_3
ROUTE SPRINKLERS TB_LKTN "Ground Floor" SPACING 3000

-- ── COMPLIANCE VERIFICATION ──

CHECK PLACEMENT TB_LKTN "Ground Floor"
CHECK CLASH TB_LKTN "Ground Floor"
VERIFY PLACEMENT TB_LKTN "Ground Floor"
